  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.4.0 adds conditional branching to functional pipelines:\n            - Added BindIf/BindIfAsync for conditional processing without breaking chains\n            - Full async support with 7 overloads covering all async scenarios\n            - Async predicate support for database-backed conditional logic\n            - Enables clean short-circuit patterns in Railway-Oriented Programming\n            All changes are backwards compatible. No breaking changes.\n            See RELEASE_NOTES_1.4.0.md for full details.",
